    <title>Vol.068 防御性医疗的形成与影响，我们又能做些什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6adf31f1c96c8942ec128075</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6adf31f1c96c8942ec128075</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 11:05:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>防御性医疗（Defensive Medicine）是指医护人员为了避免卷入医疗纠纷、投诉、处分或诉讼，采取偏离最佳医学实务及病人利益的医疗行为。本期分享防御性医疗形成的历史、影响，和我们能做些什么。</span></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 内容简介</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a> 对医护的影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="807">13:27</a> 对患者的影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> 形成过程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 做点什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2253">37:33</a> 两个小故事</span></p><p><span>【本期提到】</span></p><ul><li><p><span>文章：《医生必备防御性医疗话术100句》</span></p></li><li><p><span>影视：《周一清晨Monday Mornings》</span></p></li></ul><p><span>【支持发热电台】</span></p><p><span>欢迎通过以下方式支持发热电台的创作。</span></p><ul><li><p><span>爱发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.com/a/feverradio" data-url="https://afdian.com/a/feverradio"><span>afdian.com</span></a></p></li><li><p><span>Patreon：</span><a href="https://www.patreon.com/feverradio" data-url="https://www.patreon.com/feverradio"><span>www.patreon.com</span></a></p></li></ul><p><span>【更多信息】</span></p><ul><li><p><span>网站：feverradio.club</span></p></li><li><p><span>微信公众号：发热 FeverRadio</span></p></li><li><p><span>发热小助手微信：farexiaozhushou</span></p></li><li><p><span>邮箱：feverradio@outlook.com</span></p></li><li><p><span>RSS：</span><a href="https://feverradio.club/feed/audio.xml" data-url="https://feverradio.club/feed/audio.xml"><span>https://feverradio.club/feed/audio.xml</span></a></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>©发热电台FeverRadio Copyright 2019-2026</span></p><p><span>分享医学常识，追求良好生活。</span></p>]]></description>
