    <title>Vol.066 一位脊柱外科医生的十年和一天：学医、行医、教学与科研 - Jerry（CHC 07）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a1a5efdac7bdb080c330b5c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a1a5efdac7bdb080c330b5c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一位年轻脊柱外科医生的成长经历和工作内容。本期邀请一位老同学分享他的学医、行医手术、教学和科研的经历和心得。</span></p><p><span>专题简介：CHC（Cure, Help, Comfort）是一个系列专题，将邀请在医疗系统中学习或工作的嘉宾，包括医学生、医生、护士等，分享他们的个体经历和相关健康知识。我们期望从这些在系统中常常作为主语出现的角色的视角，来理解我们的健康和生活，也能从中看见他们遇到的困境和做出的努力。</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：张杰Jerry</span></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 嘉宾简介</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> 目前状态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">03:31</a> 报考医学院</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="499">08:19</a> 转专业过程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> 选择脊柱外科</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1112">18:32</a> 印象深刻的事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1284">21:24</a> 住院医师规范化培训</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a> 目前的工作作息</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> 行医-日常疾病</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2587">43:07</a> 行医-手术过程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3395">56:35</a> 行医-提高手术能力的心得</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4076">01:07:56</a> 行医-患者故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4367">01:12:47</a> 行医-医生的健康</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4503">01:15:03</a> 教学-日常教学工作</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4769">01:19:29</a> 教学-教学和临床的关系</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5419">01:30:19</a> 科研-经历和心得</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5992">01:39:52</a> 看重学生的能力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6064">01:41:04</a> AI、自媒体和英语</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6402">01:46:42</a> 脊柱健康的建议</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6745">01:52:25</a> 高中生寄语</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6779">01:52:59</a> 医学生寄语</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6939">01:55:39</a> 推荐环节</span></p><p><span>【本期提到】</span></p><ul><li><p><span>影视：《匹兹堡医护前线 Pitt》</span></p></li><li><p><span>小说：《仙逆》</span></p></li><li><p><span>AI工具：NotebookLM</span></p></li><li><p><span>动漫：《EVA新世纪福音战士》</span></p></li></ul><p><span>【支持发热电台】</span></p><p><span>欢迎通过以下方式支持发热电台的创作。</span></p><ul><li><p><span>爱发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.com/a/feverradio" data-url="https://afdian.com/a/feverradio"><span>afdian.com</span></a></p></li><li><p><span>Patreon：</span><a href="https://www.patreon.com/feverradio" data-url="https://www.patreon.com/feverradio"><span>www.patreon.com</span></a></p></li></ul><p><span>【更多信息】</span></p><ul><li><p><span>网站：</span><a href="http://feverradio.club" data-url="http://feverradio.club"><span>feverradio.club</span></a></p></li><li><p><span>微信公众号：发热 FeverRadio</span></p></li><li><p><span>发热小助手微信：farexiaozhushou</span></p></li><li><p><span>邮箱：feverradio@outlook.com</span></p></li><li><p><span>RSS：</span><a href="https://feverradio.club/feed/audio.xml" data-url="https://feverradio.club/feed/audio.xml"><span>https://feverradio.club/feed/audio.xml</span></a></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>©发热电台FeverRadio Copyright 2026</span></p><p><span>分享医学常识，追求良好生活。</span></p>]]></description>
